E-commerce Application with AI-Personalized Recommendations – Manual Testing
Project Overview
This project demonstrates manual testing performed on an E-commerce application with AI-powered personalized recommendations.
The objective was to validate core shopping flows (search, filters, product details, cart, checkout, wishlist, coupons, orders) and ensure recommendation behavior was relevant, explainable, privacy-safe, and resilient.

Application Under Test
Application: E-commerce Shop (nopCommerce demo + AI personalization build)
Technology: nopCommerce platform with AI recommendation engine
Testing Type: Manual Testing

Testing Performed
Smoke Testing – Login, search, cart, checkout

Sanity Testing – Targeted fixes for catalog, coupons, recommendations

Functional Testing – Search, filters, product details, cart, checkout, wishlist, coupons, orders

Boundary Testing – Quantity limits, coupon thresholds, search inputs

Negative Testing – Invalid login, invalid coupons, out-of-stock checkout, duplicate orders

Resilience & Recovery Testing – Network drops, retries, cart abandonment

Usability & Accessibility Testing – Error messages, responsive layouts, screen reader support

Compatibility Testing – Cross-browser, mobile, responsive widths

Performance Testing – Page load, search response, checkout timing

Personalization Testing – Behavior profiles (electronics, fashion, repeat buyer, cold start, abandoner)

