Project Outcome
The project provided practical experience in risk-based manual testing of e-commerce applications with AI personalization.
It validated shopping flows, coupon rules, inventory transitions, duplicate order prevention, and recommendation relevance across multiple synthetic user profiles.
Candidate defects were documented for privacy leakage, stale recommendations, coupon stacking, and responsive checkout issues.
The project strengthened skills in functional, boundary, negative, resilience, usability, and personalization testing.
